(CommerceOS already includes a world-class enterprise schema designed for multi-channel syndication:) Tj
T* (• Product: Central SSOT for SKU, Name, Brand, Category, Barcode, HSN, Tax Rate, MRP, Cost Price, Selling Price, and Storage) Tj
T* (Stock.) Tj
T* (• MasterListing: Stores canonical description, bullet points, revision history, and links to master attributes.) Tj
T* (• MasterAttribute: Key-value pairs for product specifications \(e.g., color, material, dimensions\).) Tj
T* (• MarketplaceRegistry: Pre-configured directory for AMAZON, FLIPKART, MEESHO, SHOPIFY, etc.) Tj
T* (• MarketplaceSchema & MarketplaceAttributeDefinition: Official taxonomy & attribute schemas per channel.) Tj
T* (• MarketplaceCategoryMapping: Bridges CommerceOS categories to official marketplace categories.) Tj
T* (• MarketplaceListing: Stores ASIN, FSN, listing status, buy box %, and sync error logs.) Tj
