39.6850393700787407 490.7293700787401463 Td
(1. Direct Field Mapping: Standard 1-to-1 attribute aliases \(e.g. Master `brand` -> Amazon `brand` -> Flipkart `brand`\).) Tj
T* (2. Value Dictionaries \(Lookup Tables\): If CommerceOS color is 'Navy Blue', lookup table translates it to Amazon: `color_name:) Tj
T* ('Navy Blue'` + `color_map: 'Blue'`, and Flipkart: `color_family: 'Blue'`.) Tj
T* (3. Unit & Formula Converters: Automated mathematical transformations \(e.g. Dimensions in cm to inches/mm, weight in grams to) Tj
T* (kilograms\) without guessing.) Tj
T* (4. Deterministic String Templates: Channel-optimized title and description generators using simple mustache templates:) Tj
T* (   • Amazon Title: {{brand}} {{title}} for {{gender}} \({{color}}, Size {{size}}\)) Tj
T* (   • Flipkart Title: {{brand}} {{title}} {{ideal_for}} \({{color}}\)) Tj
